# Scope-list-completion loop

For a list of scopes:

1. **For each scope**: Enter plan mode → produce full plan → implement fully → verify (hard gate) → post-implementation checklist → governance → review-scope (hard gate) → handoff brief → assess. See `.cursor/skills/scope-list-implementation-loop/SKILL.md`.
2. **Repeat** until every scope is complete and scope-list items are marked `[x]` in the scope list file.
3. **Do not stop** until there are no open scope-list todos. Escalate (RCA, re-plan) on repeated failure — never skip scope or terminal BLOCKED.

Do not leave a scope half-done or skip the checklist; move to the next scope only after the current one is fully done and assessed.
